      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 548,
      "width": 293.15000000000003,
      "height": 65,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "8 records. Four where the fee matches no\npublished rate, three failed-and-retried\npayments, and the partial. Each one has a\nreason on screen and a drafted next step.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8 records. Four where the fee matches no\npublished rate, three failed-and-retried\npayments, and the partial. Each one has a\nreason on screen and a drafted next step.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5c5f66",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
