      "width": 185.9,
      "height": 113.75,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "And the 5 timing rows\nare not in the gap at all.\nThey settled on the 1st,\nso Razorpay bills them\nnext month. Not an error.\nTrace says which month\nto expect them in.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "And the 5 timing rows\nare not in the gap at all.\nThey settled on the 1st,\nso Razorpay bills them\nnext month. Not an error.\nTrace says which month\nto expect them in.",
